nimators":{"c6d5bb35-8899-58aa-88a0-050180ea56e5":{"name":"flame","type":"bone","keyframes":[{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"901c5b01-d5c6-509c-8bf5-f23a90c964e1","time":0.0,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":0.18,"y":0.3,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"400e465d-0679-5816-a789-f25dbb31edd4","time":0.2,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":-0.15,"y":-0.09,"z":0.09}],"uuid":"312823a0-059b-56c6-969d-3abd82e4cedf","time":0.4,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":0.09,"y":0.18,"z":-0.09}],"uuid":"d2210f31-3c13-5786-8e0e-ccaabe95e1ae","time":0.6,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"75f8d493-c425-520d-8706-fb206079857d","time":0.8,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"}]}}}],"description":"# torch_hand\n\nHand torch, about 60 cm (21 u): a straight softwood stick with bark patches, a resin-soaked rag head (dark amber, char marks) bound with two turns of cord. Item: grip at the origin, head forward (-Z).\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -2..2, y -2..2, z -24..5 units (0.09 x 0.09 x 0.83 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 32 x 32, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 19.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 3 x 3 x 29 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z -10\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `lit` (visible by default): two or three flame cubes (`glow_flame*`, yellow core, orange outer) beyond the head and an `fx_flame` point\n- `snuffed`: charred black-grey head with two dull orange ember pixels (`glow_ember*`)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `flicker` | 0.8 | loop | the flame group `flame` jitters (the light flicker itself is the game's) |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `fx_flame` at (0, 0, -24)\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_ember, glow_ember_2, glow_flame, glow_flame_1, glow_flame_2\n\n## Notes\n\n- Carried in `slot_hand_l` (or `slot_hand_r` when that hand is busy). The game switches between `lit` and `snuffed`. Hit box: none (held item).\n"}